Error [E0122]: `run` returns the wrong kind of value
  --> tests/ui/run_returns_value.jet:1:4
    |
  1 | fn run() -> Int {
    |    ^^^
 Why: `run` is where running starts; it either returns nothing or reports top-level errors with `Void ?`
 Fix: write `fn run() { ... }`, or `fn run() -> Void ? { ... }` if the entry uses `?`
